    <div class="ticker-item red"><span class="dot"></span>New giveaway: VIP Test Drive Access — 3 days left</div>
    <div class="ticker-item"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Maria L.</strong> joined the Pro Investment Plan — 1 hour ago</div>
    <div class="ticker-item red"><span class="dot"></span><strong>David C.</strong> ordered Tesla Roadster — 2 hours ago</div>
    <div class="ticker-item"><span class="dot"></span>BTC at <strong>$67,420</strong> · ETH at <strong>$3,580</strong> · USDT stable</div>
    <div class="ticker-item red"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Chioma A.</strong> won Tesla Mini Giveaway — Yesterday</div>
